<!--
  Vehicle types referenced by §7.1's type_composition schema
  (bike, auto, car, truck, ambulance). Loaded as a SUMO "additional"
  file by route generation / simulation, not by netconvert — vehicle
  types are unrelated to network compilation.
-->
<additional>
